# The two-card comparison, round 1 of 3, and the sweep's confirmation, round 1 of 5 (rg-r4 and rg-r5 end it), on a
# fresh sample of the agents (seed 21):
# each card's part of every arrangement in benchmarks/quality/RESOURCE-GATE.md as a point of its own (voice alone with
# two callers and with one, the agents alone on the frozen box at 24 and 12 session trees and on the agents-only card at
# 24, 20, 16 and 12, one caller beside 12 session trees on the frozen box and on the change at a step cap of 256, two
# callers beside 12 on both, a consolidated card at half the agents and, for the consolidated card's envelope, at 8, 4
# and 2 session trees, and two callers beside 24 on the change at 256, on the frozen box and on W5's 48-token
# configuration; beside them, a warm spare's agents alone on the change at 256, at 16 and 12 session trees). Round N
# runs its engine groups in an order rotated by one from round to round, on the GPU node FLATSHARE_GPU names, the
# rounds' nodes swapped between rounds.
#   FLATSHARE_GPU=NODE benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --pause benchmarks/e2/rg-r1.campaign

agents-seed 21

# engine frozen
arms/w5-a1-voice.toml
arms/rg-voice-c1.toml
arms/rg-disc-agents-frozen-s24.toml
arms/rg-disc-agents-frozen-s12.toml
arms/rg-disc-frozen-c1-s12.toml
arms/rg-disc-frozen-s12.toml
arms/rg-disc-frozen-s8.toml
arms/rg-disc-frozen-s4.toml
arms/rg-disc-frozen-s2.toml
arms/w5-disc-frozen-s24.toml

# engine agents-only
arms/rg-disc-agents-only-s24.toml
arms/rg-disc-agents-only-s20.toml
arms/rg-disc-agents-only-s16.toml
arms/rg-disc-agents-only-s12.toml

